  "name": "Example: Computing the Variance of a Constant",
  "problem": "Calculate $\\textrm{Var}[4k^2-1]$ where $k$ is a constant.",
  "worked_solution": "Recall that for any constant $a,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\textrm{Var}[a] = 0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, since $k$ is a constant, $4k^2-1$ is also a constant, and we have\n\n$$\n\\textrm{Var}[4k^2-1] = 0.\n$$",
